{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"i18n":1},{"translations":2,"records":113,"locale":118,"route":119,"preferred":120},{"cs":3,"en":63},{"site.tagline":4,"nav.home":5,"nav.docs":6,"nav.examples":7,"nav.playground":8,"nav.github":9,"nav.npm":10,"nav.language":11,"lang.en":12,"lang.cs":13,"lang.de":14,"banner.v3":15,"error.title":16,"error.404":17,"error.default":18,"error.home":19,"playground":20},"Internacionalizace pro SvelteKit","Domů","Dokumentace","Příklady","Hřiště","GitHub","npm","Jazyk","English","Čeština","Deutsch","Toto je dokumentace k v3. Pro řadu v2 se podívej na větev {{branch}}.","Něco se pokazilo","Tato stránka neexistuje.","Došlo k neočekávané chybě.","Zpět na úvodní stránku",{"title":8,"lead":21,"source":22,"output":23,"parser":24,"preprocess":36,"loaders":42,"fallback":58},"Každý panel níže řídí skutečnou instanci přes veřejné API. Změň vstup a knihovna odpoví — nic tady není nahrávka.","Zobrazit kód","Výstup",{"title":25,"lead":26,"format":27,"flavour":28,"message":33,"payload":34,"locale":11,"silent":35},"Formáty zpráv","Jádro samo žádný formát zpráv nemá: slot vyplňuje parser. Curly přichází s tímto balíčkem; ICU, MessageFormat 2 a i18next jsou alternativy postavené přímo na jádře.","Formát zprávy",{"curly":29,"icu":30,"mf2":31,"i18next":32},"Curly","ICU","MF2","i18next","Zpráva","Data","Žádná hlášení. Hlášení nikdy nevyhodí výjimku — placeholder vezme svou náhradu a zbytek zprávy se vyhodnotí.",{"title":37,"lead":38,"input":39,"mode":40,"note":41},"Předzpracování","Z vnořených překladů se stávají ploché klíče, které čte t(). Jak daleko se zajde, určuje režim.","Překlady","Režim","rawTranslations drží vstup tak, jak přišel; translations je to, co vidíš tady.",{"title":43,"lead":44,"locale":11,"route":45,"load":46,"invalidate":47,"reset":48,"empty":49,"shape":50,"status":54},"Loadery","Loader se spustí, když sedí jeho jazyk i jeho routes na aktuální route, jednou za okno čerstvosti a parametry route. Každý loader se eviduje zvlášť. Načti stejnou route dvakrát a sleduj, jak druhý pokus neudělá nic.","Route","Načíst překlady","Invalidovat","Reset","Vyber jazyk a route, pak načti.",{"every":51,"exact":52,"pattern":53},"bez routes — každá route","řetězec — přesná shoda","vzor — celá sekce",{"ran":55,"cached":56,"skipped":57},"spustil se","už načteno","neodpovídá",{"title":59,"lead":60,"key":61,"note":62},"Záložní jazyk","Klíč, který aktivní jazyk nemá, se vyhodnotí přes fallbackLocale, místo aby zůstal prázdný.","Klíč","Zálohují se jen chybějící klíče. Co vykreslí klíč chybějící všude, určuje fallbackValue.",{"site.tagline":64,"nav.home":65,"nav.docs":66,"nav.examples":67,"nav.playground":68,"nav.github":9,"nav.npm":10,"nav.language":69,"lang.en":12,"lang.cs":13,"lang.de":14,"banner.v3":70,"error.title":71,"error.404":72,"error.default":73,"error.home":74,"playground":75},"Internationalization for SvelteKit","Home","Documentation","Examples","Playground","Language","This is the documentation for v3. For the v2 line, see the {{branch}} branch.","Something went wrong","This page does not exist.","An unexpected error occurred.","Back to the homepage",{"title":68,"lead":76,"source":77,"output":78,"parser":79,"preprocess":88,"loaders":94,"fallback":108},"Every panel below drives a real instance through the public API. Change an input and the library answers — nothing here is a recording.","Show the code","Output",{"title":80,"lead":81,"format":82,"flavour":83,"message":84,"payload":85,"locale":86,"silent":87},"Message formats","The core holds no message format of its own: a parser fills the slot. Curly comes with this package; ICU, MessageFormat 2 and i18next are the alternatives, on the core directly.","Message format",{"curly":29,"icu":30,"mf2":31,"i18next":32},"Message","Payload","Locale","No reports. A report never raises — the placeholder takes its fallback and the rest of the message resolves.",{"title":89,"lead":90,"input":91,"mode":92,"note":93},"Preprocessing","Nested translations become the flat keys t() reads. The mode decides how far that goes.","Translations","Mode","rawTranslations keeps the input as it arrived; translations is what you see here.",{"title":95,"lead":96,"locale":86,"route":45,"load":97,"invalidate":98,"reset":48,"empty":99,"shape":100,"status":104},"Loaders","A loader runs when its locale matches and its routes match the current route, once per freshness window and route params. Each loader is recorded on its own. Load the same route twice and watch the second attempt do nothing.","Load translations","Invalidate","Pick a locale and a route, then load.",{"every":101,"exact":102,"pattern":103},"no routes — every route","a string — exact match","a pattern — a whole section",{"ran":105,"cached":106,"skipped":107},"ran","already loaded","did not match",{"title":109,"lead":110,"key":111,"note":112},"Fallback locale","A key the active locale does not carry resolves through fallbackLocale instead of rendering empty.","Key","Only the missing keys fall back. What a key missing everywhere renders as is fallbackValue.",[114,116],{"id":115},"[\"en\",\"playground\",[\"s:/playground\",\"s:/cs/playground\",\"s:/de/playground\"]]",{"id":117},"[\"cs\",\"playground\",[\"s:/playground\",\"s:/cs/playground\",\"s:/de/playground\"]]","cs","/cs/playground",true],"uses":{"route":1,"url":1}},{"type":"data","data":[{"code":1},{"parser":2,"preprocess":7,"loaders":11,"fallback":12},{"curly":3,"icu":4,"mf2":5,"i18next":6},"\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { I18n } \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sveltekit-i18n'\u003C/